<header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Digivated</p><h1>Terms of Use</h1><p class="lede">The short version of how Digivated works.</p></header>
<article class="article-body"><h2>Sharing your work</h2><p>Only submit work you’re allowed to share, and keep the details accurate. Every account can have 1 project on Digivated for free. A free launch goes live on its launch date once your badge is verified. Starter ($3, paid once) lets you have up to 3 projects on the site at a time, and each one goes live as soon as you publish it. Plans count the projects you have on the site now, live or waiting; archiving or deleting one frees a slot.</p><h2>Digivated Pro</h2><p><a href="/membership">Digivated Pro</a> costs $5 USD, paid once. It’s not a subscription. It includes unlimited projects that go live as soon as you publish them. News is free for everyone.</p><p>Paid plans use the email on your Digivated account, and one purchase upgrades one account. Projects on any plan must follow the listing rules, and we remove ones that don’t. Paying doesn’t guarantee traffic, engagement, or sales. Refunded, charged-back, or revoked purchases lose their access. Gumroad handles checkout, receipts, taxes, and the terms shown at checkout.</p><h2>Previous purchases</h2><p>Older purchases keep what they included. Prompt Packet licenses work on the <a href="/access">access page</a>. Founding Membership licenses and purchase emails work on the <a href="/membership#member-sign-in">member sign-in page</a>. A promotion bought earlier can still be submitted for review. We no longer sell these on their own.</p><h2>Independent projects</h2><p>Listed projects are run by other people. Check their terms and privacy practices before you use or buy anything. A listing isn’t a guarantee of how a project performs.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact <a href="https://x.com/digivatedx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Digivated on X</a> for help with the site or a listing.</p></article>
</Platform>
